      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7302104",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain \"Living Spring\"",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730210401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730210401": {
            "id": "730210401",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Hmm... It is the water from the river's source. The Living Spring that's cold and clean, just like moonlight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210402"
            ]
          },
          "730210402": {
            "id": "730210402",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Arachatora, Arasaka, and Araphala wouldn't be so stupid if they grew up drinking this water. Only Arapacati, my sister...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210403"
            ]
          },
          "730210403": {
            "id": "730210403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, what's next...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210404"
            ]
          },
          "730210404": {
            "id": "730210404",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Huh? Oh. Next up, you have to make me a new pot of soup...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210405"
            ]
          },
          "730210405": {
            "id": "730210405",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Receiving guidance from Arapas, you add some fruits and vegetables into the water and start cooking.\\nA rather nice aroma slowly emerges from the pot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210406"
            ]
          },
          "730210406": {
            "id": "730210406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Once you're done, you taste the fresh soup together.\\nIt sort of lives up to your expectations. It does carry the aroma of the ingredients...\\nBut a soup without any condiments is just too plain.\\nIt has no flavor at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210407"
            ]
          },
          "730210407": {
            "id": "730210407",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Mmm, this is how the supreme delicacy should smell!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210408"
            ]
          },
          "730210408": {
            "id": "730210408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hmm... What do you think, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210411"
            ]
          },
          "730210411": {
            "id": "730210411",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon thinks it would be better with some salt and pepper.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210412"
            ]
          },
          "730210412": {
            "id": "730210412",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Everything is better with salt and pepper.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210413"
            ]
          },
          "730210413": {
            "id": "730210413",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Great Aramuhukunda! You want to add salt? What a horrifying idea!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210414"
            ]
          },
          "730210414": {
            "id": "730210414",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Land with salt is land without life, and Aranara will be forced to shrink into seeds. Yet Nara wish to add salt!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210415"
            ]
          },
          "730210415": {
            "id": "730210415",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Soups are supposed to be bland! How do you Nara not even understand that!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210416"
            ]
          },
          "730210416": {
            "id": "730210416",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "That Nara from before told us a story after having a bowl of my soup:",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210417"
            ]
          },
          "730210417": {
            "id": "730210417",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "\"When we Nara children come home, the aroma of soup is the first thing we smell. As such, aroma is all a soup needs.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210418"
            ]
          },
          "730210418": {
            "id": "730210418",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "#After that, {F#he}{M#she} complimented the aroma of the soup I made. I've never forgotten that. That's why I won't believe a word you say!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210419"
            ]
          },
          "730210419": {
            "id": "730210419",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But just aroma isn't enough...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210420"
            ]
          },
          "730210420": {
            "id": "730210420",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210421"
            ]
          },
          "730210421": {
            "id": "730210421",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Hmph! But since you're the Nara of this Festival Utsava, I'm sure you've received approval from Araja and Arapacati. So... I'll try making a soup with taste.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210422"
            ]
          },
          "730210422": {
            "id": "730210422",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Next time, I'll look for even better water, so we can make even better soup!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210423"
            ]
          },
          "730210423": {
            "id": "730210423",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...I don't think water is the problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210424"
            ]
          },
          "730210424": {
            "id": "730210424",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Really? Anyway, my cooking training has concluded. Alright, let's see what we can do about this at Festival Utsava!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210425"
            ]
          },
          "730210425": {
            "id": "730210425",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "I've taught you how to make the soup. It's a soup approved by the Great Nara, so do give it a few more tries. But make sure you don't forget to use good water!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730210426"
            ]
          },
          "730210426": {
            "id": "730210426",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#({NICKNAME}, let's add some seasoning next time. It should be pretty good after that...)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7302105",
      "subQuestName": "Give Living Spring to Arapas",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730210501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730210501": {
            "id": "730210501",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Arapas",
            "text": "Is there water that can give taste to soup?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
